{"node_id":"LVMC_11_20_060_o3","law_refs":["LVMC-11-20-060"],"subject":{"binder":"subject","class_elements":["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"]},"segmentation":[{"id":"e1","text":"The driver of a vehicle","role":"subject"},{"id":"e2","text":"within a business or residence district","role":"condition"},{"id":"e3","text":"emerging or entering an alley, driveway or building","role":"condition"},{"id":"e4","text":"shall stop such vehicle","role":"sibling"},{"id":"e5","text":"immediately prior to driving onto a sidewalk or onto the sidewalk area extending across any alleyway or driveway","role":"sibling"},{"id":"e6","text":"yielding","role":"sibling"},{"id":"e7","text":"the right-of-way","role":"sibling"},{"id":"e8","text":"to any pedestrian","role":"sibling"},{"id":"e9","text":"as may be necessary to avoid collision","role":"sibling"},{"id":"e10","text":"and","role":"boilerplate"},{"id":"e11","text":"upon entering the roadway","role":"trigger"},{"id":"e12","text":"shall yield","role":"obligation"},{"id":"e13","text":"the right-of-way","role":"standard"},{"id":"e14","text":"to all vehicles approaching on said roadway","role":"condition"}],"elements":[{"span":"e1","atoms":["ru.aggregate=DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle"],"derived":[],"justification":"'vehicle' is the admitted aggregate DEF-NRS-484A-320::vehicle; 'The driver of' is read through the vehicle's controlled motion (agency)."},{"span":"e3","atoms":["st.driveway_or_alley_entrance","st.alley","rel.occupies"],"derived":[],"justification":"As LVMC_11_20_060_o1; for entering the roadway only 'emerging' applies: the subject has occupied the driveway-or-alley-entrance or alley region d (st.driveway_or_alley_entrance 'private road, alley or driveway meeting the highway', st.alley, rel.occupies) continuously since an observation at which it occupied d and not the roadway."},{"span":"e11","atoms":["st.roadway","rel.occupies"],"derived":[],"justification":"st.roadway 'the part of a highway improved for vehicular traffic, e